{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "6189b86635e58464ef9fe8e7f7a0fc3e85e8d8cbfd253bcb1dc92b628f99e4eb", "ja": "お忍びアイドル、参戦！", "zh": "微服偶像，参战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5d9de666240a3b1c1482fc1b3e9b473bf14691c2ed307a0956cf17feceb5ba27", "ja": "特設ステージにて、カラオケ大会が開催中！\nプロデューサーに「お忍びなら参加OK」と\n言われ、思わず体がうずく真と静香。さらに\n優勝者には高級和牛のプレゼントがあると聞\nき、昴まで本気に……？", "zh": "特设舞台上，卡拉OK大会正在举办！\n制作人告诉她们“只要乔装参加就没问题”，\n真和静香不由得跃跃欲试。又听说优胜者能获\n赠高级和牛，连昴也认真起来了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "9fffcb4d62a51b0b9a64f96ec8e31304cf6397f2e784078fb8c8e8ddf5aeee90", "ja": "ねえねえ、見てよ！\n特設ステージでカラオケ大会やってるんだって！", "zh": "喂喂，快看！\n听说特设舞台正在举办卡拉OK大赛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "94019e27379c5c55e963d933f6aa3a9b1ebb302d67fc6e8cba930ef6c52f81e0", "ja": "マジ！？　すっげー楽しそうじゃん！\nそれって、オレたちも参加していいのかな？", "zh": "真的吗！？看起来超有意思！\n那个，我们也可以参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2a6541549aba562f9b9a230abef81ce4c6877abf2d34bdfef353375d8f47719c", "ja": "基本、ファンの人たち向けの大会だからな？\n今日のところは……。", "zh": "这主要是面向粉丝们的比赛吧？\n今天就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "b6ce9e4f839a598ae5c21eaf8ddd60a31d0cb4d906d2e326f69391fa32c41001", "ja": "そ、そうですよね。私たちはプロですし。\nカラオケに参加したら……。", "zh": "是、是这样吧。毕竟我们是专业偶像。\n要是参加卡拉OK的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c9ce247a98db04acbab8eced8569bd0371b0f89de1f744b0f6084384a330b1e2", "ja": "とはいえ、お忍びという形でならオッケーだよ。\nただし、他の仕事に影響を出さないように！", "zh": "话虽如此，要是以微服出行的形式，那就没问题。\n不过，可别影响到其他工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "8b6689ac02c1e4a90b40cf3c2fbf7abebc33a44d6f045cf83dc502129eb98f71", "ja": "えっ！　いいんですか！？\nそういうことなら……何の曲にしよっかな♪", "zh": "诶！　真的可以吗！？\n既然这样……选什么歌好呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "55ce5f1054c335c36c798c9a956387de36e8735a971af0b54b48be9cd62582ac", "ja": "こほ、コホン……あー！　あー！　ライブに向けて\n調整していたので、喉の調子はばっちりです……！", "zh": "咳、咳咳……啊——！啊——！我一直在为演唱会调整状态，所以嗓子的状况好得不得了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "91eb8ac92fec87138d9e10d3a5ff1fc67b3157543c29126b8f87ca319d9dc4b6", "ja": "なあ、{$P$}。\nなんか本気出そうとしてる人がいるんだけど。", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。\n好像有人正准备认真起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ac8f4db27ce66f556d0b496273a44edf1cedb646e155f97efd83e6e5ce532a4f", "ja": "えーと……。", "zh": "呃……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "e385899dfbc95b40db1b7c7ff71bdc01bc8042bef5b2623fb3147fab0d87856b", "ja": "大丈夫です！　審査員の仕事に支障をきたさないよう、\n参加するタイミングは十分考えてます！", "zh": "没问题的！为了不妨碍评审员的工作，\n我充分考虑过参加的时机了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "dcf3910cb473775ca7a7f2b225d1a19f39b72360edac893b58b828c7b9631f0e", "ja": "え、静香、審査員なの！？\nもー、ちゃんと審査しろよー？", "zh": "诶，静香，你是评委啊！？\n真是的，你可得好好评审啊——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "9cf2601a643a8e2ec639d31d6b4f0faacadbb0e5b4faa4603b813b7975fb3518", "ja": "ちなみに、優勝賞品はなんですか！？\n内容によっては、ボクも本気出さないと……！", "zh": "顺便问一下，冠军奖品是什么！？\n要是奖品不错，我也得认真起来才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "453ce640b88d509ae7134c9b192b1bac89123bf4c49aca54ecd0beb30286362d", "ja": "優勝者には、なんと高級和牛10万円分プレゼントだ！\nスポンサーに感謝しないとな……。", "zh": "冠军奖品竟然是价值10万日元的高级和牛！\n得好好感谢赞助商才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_02_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "603719e6b09fb3a34adafd5241534159bf8d85e44792037749b545ce455a3cc0", "ja": "高級和牛！？　すっげー！　肉がもらえるなら、\nオレもチャレンジしてみよっかなー！", "zh": "高级和牛！？太棒了！要是能拿到肉的话，我也要不要挑战一下呢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
